OL,5,G0400 Early Breakfast with Sam Pittis
OL,6,     FJoin Sam for the ideal selection
OL,7,     Fof music if you rise first thing
OL,8,     Fin the morning. The programme
OL,9,     Ffeatures half-hourly news and
OL,10,     Fweather updates from 5:00am and
OL,11,     Fthe Dawn Chorus at 5:1
